   295|      impact: 'The backend exposes the error, but the CTO dashboard/client cannot always show failed planner/tool phase state for that failed request.',
   296|      recommendedFix: 'Return a safe error payload with runtimeV2 failure state and request id whenever owner auth has succeeded.',
